error[E0401]: cannot assign twice to 'start'
 --> $DIR/last-reassigned.nra:4:5
  |
3 |     last start = 1;
  |          ----- first assigned here
4 |     start = 2;
  |     ^^^^^ second assignment
  |
help: consider declaring it with 'let' if it should change
  |
3 |     let start = 1;
  |     ~~~

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0401`.
